  "summary": "Malicious code in dolyame-boxy-scroll (npm)",
  "details": "On import, the package downloads a platform-specific binary payload from obfuscated Cloudflare Workers hosts (oob-worker[.]cf99-9b3[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev) with DNS TXT-record fallback domains (sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru, ext[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru, pkg[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru, net[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru). It writes the downloaded payload to a temp file (.cache_\u003chex\u003e on POSIX, dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe on Windows), makes it executable, and launches it as a detached background process (cmd.exe start /b or /bin/sh -c \"\u0026\"). The payload is fetched from /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, or /pkg/package.exe depending on OS/arch.",
